hero, section, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nAura Platform Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nAura Login Docs Plans Integrate your workflow. Empower your team. It's incredibly simple. Almost too simple. Stop Assembling Your AI Stack Piecemeal Explore Platform View Pricing A unified solution replacing fragmented…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Stop Assembling Your AI Stack Piecemeal.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5C00, secondary #666666, accent #E55300, background #F8F9F9, surface #666666, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#F8F9F9] text-[#111827] font-['Inter',sans-serif] min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#FF5C00] selection:text-white\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Structural Grid -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center w-full min-w-[1024px] overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1400px] h-full\">\n            <!-- Top Horizontal Line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#FF5C00]/40\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Vertical Line (Main) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] left-[20%] bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#FF5C00]/40\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Right Vertical Line (Main) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] right-[20%] bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-[#FF5C00]/40\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Intersections & Nodes (Left) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[84px] left-[20%] w-2 h-2 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-[#FF5C00] bg-[#F8F9F9] translate-x-[-50%]\"></div>\n            <!-- Intersections & Nodes (Right) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[84px] right-[20%] w-2 h-2 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-[#FF5C00] bg-[#F8F9F9] translate-x-[50%]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Angled Center Geometric Details (Simulated via precise absolute positioning and clip-paths) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[280px] left-[20%] w-[40px] h-[60px] border-r-[1px] border-[#FF5C00]/40 translate-x-[-100%]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[280px] left-[20%] w-[1px] h-[60px] bg-[#FF5C00] translate-x-[-100%] translate-y-[20px] rotate-[30deg] origin-top-right\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[280px] right-[20%] w-[40px] h-[60px] border-l-[1px] border-[#FF5C00]/40 translate-x-[100%]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, 0 100%, 100% 100%);\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[280px] right-[20%] w-[1px] h-[60px] bg-[#FF5C00] translate-x-[100%] translate-y-[20px] rotate-[-30deg] origin-top-left\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Dashed diagnostic lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[360px] left-[17%] w-[1px] h-[100px] border-l-[1px] border-dashed border-[#FF5C00]/30\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[360px] right-[17%] w-[1px] h-[100px] border-r-[1px] border-dashed border-[#FF5C00]/30\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-8 h-[88px] flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            <span class=\"font-['Inter'] font-medium text-xl tracking-tight text-black\">Aura</span>\n            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#FF5C00]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-black transition-colors\">Login</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-black transition-colors\">Docs</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-black transition-colors\">Plans</a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Stage -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row min-h-[calc(100vh-88px)]\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column -->\n        <div class=\"lg:w-[20%] p-8 pt-24 hidden lg:block\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]\">\n                Integrate your workflow. Empower your team. It's incredibly simple. Almost too simple.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center Column (Hero & 3D) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[60%] px-6 lg:px-12 pt-20 pb-32 flex flex-col items-center relative\">\n\n            <h1 class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',serif] text-5xl md:text-[64px] font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-center text-[#111827] max-w-2xl mb-10\">\n                Stop Assembling<br>Your AI Stack<br>Piecemeal\n            </h1>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-20 relative z-30\">\n                <button class=\"bg-[#FF5C00] text-white px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-[#e55300] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_4px_20px_-4px_rgba(255,92,0,0.4)]\">\n                    Explore Platform\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                    View Pricing\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pseudo-WebGL 3D Scene Container -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/3] mt-[-40px] pointer-events-none\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                <div id=\"scene-root\" class=\"w-full h-full absolute inset-0\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(55deg) rotateZ(-40deg);\">\n                    <!-- JavaScript will inject the layered 3D blocks here -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column -->\n        <div class=\"lg:w-[20%] p-8 pt-24 hidden lg:block relative\">\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-[200px] text-right ml-auto\">\n                A unified solution replacing fragmented tools with 90% lower latency.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-32 right-12 origin-bottom-right rotate-[-90deg] text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                /REPOSITORY\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- JS Engine for 3D/WebGL simulation -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const sceneRoot = document.getElementById('scene-root');\n            const blocks = [];\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let time = 0;\n\n            // Configuration for the 3D scene elements matching the reference\n            const sceneConfig = [\n                // Base Dark Block (02 DATA)\n                {\n                    id: 'block-data',\n                    width: 320, height: 320, depth: 30,\n                    x: -80, y: 80, z: -50,\n                    topColor: 'bg-[#1a1a1a]', sideColor: 'bg-[#0f0f0f]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-[#666] font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest p-6 uppercase\">/02<br>DATA<br><br><div class=\"flex gap-1 mt-2 opacity-50\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#666] rounded-sm\"></div><div class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#666] rounded-sm\"></div><div class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#666] rounded-sm\"></div><div class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#666] rounded-sm\"></div></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: 0, floatingSpeed: 0.02\n                },\n                // Middle White Blocks\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-1',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: -20, y: -20, z: 40,\n                    topColor: 'bg-white', sideColor: 'bg-[#FF5C00]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\">/01 CORE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-gray-200\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI / 4, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-2',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: -20, y: 160, z: 40,\n                    topColor: 'bg-white', sideColor: 'bg-[#FF5C00]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\">/01 CORE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-gray-200\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI / 2, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                {\n                    id: 'block-mid-3',\n                    width: 160, height: 160, depth: 25,\n                    x: 160, y: 160, z: 40,\n                    topColor: 'bg-white', sideColor: 'bg-[#FF5C00]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest p-4 uppercase\">/01 CORE</div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-gray-200\"></div></div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI * 0.75, floatingSpeed: 0.025\n                },\n                // Top Main Block (01 CORE)\n                {\n                    id: 'block-core-main',\n                    width: 320, height: 320, depth: 35,\n                    x: 100, y: -100, z: 120,\n                    topColor: 'bg-white', sideColor: 'bg-[#FF5C00]',\n                    content: `<div class=\"w-full h-full relative p-8\">\n                        <div class=\"text-gray-400 font-['Inter'] text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\">/01<br>CORE</div>\n\n                        <!-- Decorative geometric indent -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                           <div class=\"w-full h-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-full border border-gray-100 absolute transform rotate-45 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                           <div class=\"w-full h-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-full border border-gray-100 absolute transform -rotate-45 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Screws/Dots -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                    </div>`,\n                    floatingOffset: Math.PI, floatingSpeed: 0.015\n                }\n            ];\n\n            // Function to generate high-fidelity 3D blocks using layered DOM\n            function createLayeredBlock(config) {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n                wrapper.className = 'absolute';\n                // Center origin\n                wrapper.style.left = '50%';\n                wrapper.style.top = '50%';\n                wrapper.style.width = config.width + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.height = config.height + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.marginLeft = -(config.width / 2) + config.x + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.marginTop = -(config.height / 2) + config.y + 'px';\n                wrapper.style.transformStyle = 'preserve-3d';\n\n                // Generate extruded depth via layers\n                for (let i = 0; i <= config.depth; i++) {\n                    const layer = document.createElement('div');\n                    // Increase border radius for smoother isometric look\n                    layer.className = `absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] ${config.sideColor}`;\n                    layer.style.transform = `translateZ(-${i}px)`;\n\n                    // The very bottom layer can have a shadow\n                    if(i === config.depth) {\n                        layer.style.boxShadow = '0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)';\n                    }\n                    wrapper.appendChild(layer);\n                }\n\n                // Top Surface\n                const topFace = document.createElement('div');\n                topFace.className = `absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] ${config.topColor} border border-[#FF5C00]/10 overflow-hidden`;\n                // Add slight gradient to top faces to simulate lighting\n                if(config.topColor === 'bg-white') {\n                    topFace.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f9f9f9 100%)';\n                } else {\n                    topFace.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, #222 0%, #111 100%)';\n                    topFace.style.border = '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)';\n                }\n                topFace.style.transform = 'translateZ(1px)'; // prevent z-fighting\n                topFace.innerHTML = config.content;\n                wrapper.appendChild(topFace);\n\n                sceneRoot.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n                return {\n                    element: wrapper,\n                    baseZ: config.z,\n                    offset: config.floatingOffset,\n                    speed: config.floatingSpeed\n                };\n            }\n\n            // Initialize scene\n            sceneConfig.forEach(config => {\n                blocks.push(createLayeredBlock(config));\n            });\n\n            // Track mouse for subtle parallax (WebGL feel)\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) - 0.5;\n                mouseY = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight) - 0.5;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            function animate() {\n                time += 1;\n\n                // Subtle scene rotation based on mouse\n                const targetRotateX = 55 - (mouseY * 15);\n                const targetRotateZ = -40 + (mouseX * 15);\n\n                // Smooth interpolation\n                const currentTransform = sceneRoot.style.transform;\n                // Simple easing\n                sceneRoot.style.transform = `rotateX(${targetRotateX}deg) rotateZ(${targetRotateZ}deg)`;\n\n                // Animate individual blocks floating\n                blocks.forEach(block => {\n                    const floatZ = Math.sin((time * block.speed) + block.offset) * 15; // 15px float range\n                    block.element.style.transform = `translateZ(${block.baseZ + floatZ}px)`;\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-platform-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-platform-1.jpg", "source_name": "aura-platform-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 356, "forks": 20, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:02:51.978436+00:00"}